Package: rmskProfiler
Title: Quantify transposable elements at the locus-level
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gennaro", "Calendo", , "gcalendo@coriell.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4510-5530"))
Description: An end-to-end workflow for quantifying transposable elements at the
    locus-level using RNA-seq data. This package provides functions for creating
    an index, quantifying transcripts and TEs, and importing counts into annotated
    R objects for downstream analysis. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
